   "notes": "Static 300 K slice of the report's temperature-dependent BM4 pressure-marker model. The report first constrained V0(T) from thermal expansion and K0(T) from elastic, heat-capacity, and expansivity data. It then varied K0_prime(300 K), dK0_prime/dT, and temperature-invariant K0_double_prime against a compiled 295-788 K compression dataset. The full polynomial surface is independently executable in scripts/audit_fortes_2019_fcc_pb.py, but is not stored as this isothermal record because the current thermal schema cannot represent it.",
